      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "text": "- Only 0.05, 0.10, 0.25 and 1 are\naccepted. Otherwise Coin Rejected -\nInvalid Coin\n- A 1 coin is accepted only if the whole\nbalance can be returned in 0.05, 0.10\nand 0.25. Otherwise Coin Rejected -\nRefund Not Guaranteed",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "e3lddDRcSDTcQgBpCLets",
      "originalText": "- Only 0.05, 0.10, 0.25 and 1 are accepted. Otherwise Coin Rejected - Invalid Coin\n- A 1 coin is accepted only if the whole balance can be returned in 0.05, 0.10 and 0.25. Otherwise Coin Rejected - Refund Not Guaranteed",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "az",
      "created": 1794226304480,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
